    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When you drink cold water, your teeth may have an uncomfortable feeling. If you’ve ever experienced this feeling, you may have sensitive teeth. It’s a common problem shared by millions of people around the world."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "People with sensitive teeth may experience feelings of pain when they eat or drink something cold, hot, sweet or "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "sour",
            "ref": "v-sour"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Sometimes even a deep breath of cold air can cause pain."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Scientists have found that several factors can cause you to have sensitive teeth. For example, brushing your teeth too hard can wear down the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "enamel",
            "zh": "牙釉质"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on your teeth. Foods that are "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "acidic",
            "ref": "v-acidic"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", such as sodas and tomatoes, can also "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "wear down",
            "ref": "v-wear-down"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " enamel "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "over time",
            "ref": "v-over-time"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "If your teeth are sensitive, there are a number of ways to help reduce the pain. Using a soft toothbrush and brushing your teeth carefully and gently will help. Watching what you eat and drink can help, too."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
